{"v":4,"catch":"遊戲只講述了故事的一半。","desc":"你需要跳出框框思考。 在「Trust No One」這款點擊式偵探冒險遊戲中，您扮演一名記者，試圖揭開有關一家神秘人工智慧公司的秘密網絡。探索基輔的角落和小巷，找出線人的身份《Trust No One》召喚你擁抱好奇心。遊戲的敘事展開超乎尋常，促使你跳出傳統界限進行思考。《Trust No One》是烏克蘭遊戲工作室Triomatica 繼《Boxville》的成功之後的最新作品。》榮獲2022年DevGamm最佳移動遊戲獎和2023年GDWC最佳移動遊戲獎。","publisher":"Triomatica Games","release":"2024-05-16","genres":["冒險","益智","其他"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0cf9a4765cfce5de3d01ff206187e5ffc875afedc4ab7aaea381d1e9c29d7fe2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/154692b2ebff90f25f3c7b10c22bad117220661363a90202c55f5f5e582e2f60.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d8994b24855d022847c220b91461e2686a5f77bf99f18f0f6821aa1a787a9c6d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/24bdc0c0267ae0ed51bf6edeadf327ff9508f54cc204174870ed788dce9485b1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/13c5df55af87bb62a3fe2fe26cc356368a4f8ca31be7b20edae1d70849618adb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6013cdbf703cf436f45da85513b5cbd3e242f5606de225ccc2985c7e71cc8be7.jpg"],"titleId":"0100b5601f082000","demo":["70030000021214"],"dlc":[]}